  "body": "Lot 8 Under Contract! These homes are ideal for anyone wanting to establish themselves in the area, first home buyers, professionals seeking a sophisticated lock-and-leave, or those needing a convenient Auckland base.\r\n\r\nEight terraced townhouses bring a surprisingly attainable opportunity to one of the North Shore's most sought-after locations - without compromising on space, quality or lifestyle. In a location that needs little introduction and where new homes can command a premium, this is an opportunity to secure something brand new without the price tag you might expect.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed across three levels, each home offers expansive living spaces perfect for entertaining with a modern kitchen, two or three bedrooms on the upper level, with options between en-suites or large stylish bathrooms and plenty of storage throughout the home. Not only does this property come with a spacious single garage, but also an additional ground-floor room with its own ensuite, perfectly suited to a bedroom, rumpus, home office, or home gym. \r\n\r\nSet on Lake Road, the location is exceptionally connected - minutes from Takapuna Beach, vibrant dining and retail, local amenities and with straightforward access to the CBD. Yet you still enjoy everything that makes the North Shore such a desirable place to call home. In zone for Takapuna School, Hauraki School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Belmont Intermediate, Takapuna Grammar School and Westlake Girls' High School. \r\n\r\nCome and see what makes 399 Lake Road such a fantastic opportunity. Contact Harry Richards on 02108144513 for more information. \r\n\r\nLot 1: approx 152.6sqm, 4 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms\r\n\r\nLot 2: approx 127.1sqm, 3 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms\r\n\r\nLot 3: approx 127.1sqm, 3 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms\r\n\r\nLot 4: approx 127.1sqm, 3 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms\r\n\r\nLot 5: approx 122.7sqm, 3 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms\r\n\r\nLot 6: approx 122.7sqm, 3 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms\r\n\r\nLot 7: approx 122.7sqm, 3 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms\r\n\r\nUnder Contract Lot 8: approx 148.7sqm, 4 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms",
